{
  "$schema": "../schema/component.schema.json",
  "id": "morphing-text",
  "title": "文字变形",
  "description": "用于在一组文本间以模糊渐变变形循环切换的文字动画组件。",
  "category": "effect",
  "tags": [
    "css",
    "tailwind",
    "magic-ui"
  ],
  "platforms": [
    "web"
  ],
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "class",
      "type": "string",
      "required": false,
      "description": "容器的额外类名。",
      "default": "\"\""
    },
    {
      "name": "texts",
      "type": "string[]",
      "required": true,
      "description": "需要变换的文本数组。",
      "default": "[]"
    },
    {
      "name": "morphTime",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "动画执行时间。",
      "default": "1.5"
    },
    {
      "name": "coolDownTime",
      "type": "number",
      "required": false,
      "description": "动画停留时间。",
      "default": "0.5"
    }
  ],
  "events": [],
  "slots": [],
  "exposes": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Web 演示",
      "code": "<script lang=\"ts\" setup>\nconst texts = [\n  \"Hello\",\n  \"Morphing\",\n  \"Text\",\n  \"Animation\",\n  \"Vue\",\n  \"Component\",\n  \"Smooth\",\n  \"Transition\",\n  \"Engaging\",\n];\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <ClientOnly>\n    <MorphingText :texts=\"texts\" />\n  </ClientOnly>\n</template>\n\n<style></style>\n",
      "source": "demo",
      "platform": "web"
    }
  ],
  "related": [],
  "whenToUse": [
    "Hero 区标题需要在多个关键词间循环变形切换时。",
    "展示产品的多个卖点词并强调过渡的液态变形感时。"
  ],
  "whenNotToUse": [
    "需要翻转式的词语切换，改用 flip-words 或 container-text-flip。",
    "只有一段文字的进场动画，改用 letter-pullup 或 text-generate-effect。"
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "仅 web 端可用，示例中外层包裹了 ClientOnly。",
    "texts 为必填字符串数组；morphTime 是变形动画时长、coolDownTime 是每个词的停留时间，单位均为秒。",
    "不支持插槽内容，仅渲染纯文本。"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "install": {
    "cli": "npx reborn-ui@latest add morphing-text"
  },
